{"1402020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SCP: Labrat", "steam_appid": 1402020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "You are a test subject in the underground SCP facility. When a containment breach occurs, you must find your way out. Escape the SCPs, discover anomalous objects, and collect valuable resources along the way.<br><br><i>SCP: Labrat</i> is a recreation of <i>SCP - Containment Breach</i> by Undertow Games, developed by Bezbro Games. <i>SCP - Containment Breach (SCP - CB)</i> is a 2012 horror game based on the fictional stories of the SCP Foundation. <i>SCP: Labrat</i> follows the original gameplay of <i>SCP - CB</i> and adds multiple features to improve the experience.<br><br>Some <i>SCP: Labrat</i> features include:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Singleplayer and Multiplayer modes.<br></li><li> New SCPs, items, and events in addition to the originals.<br></li><li> An immersive VR player suited with a full body and physics interaction.<br></li><li> Multiple improvements to original <i>SCP - Containment Breach</i> assets.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "You are a test subject in the underground SCP facility. When a containment breach occurs, you must find your way out. Escape the SCPs, discover anomalous objects, and collect valuable resources along the way.<br><br><i>SCP: Labrat</i> is a recreation of <i>SCP - Containment Breach</i> by Undertow Games, developed by Bezbro Games. <i>SCP - Containment Breach (SCP - CB)</i> is a 2012 horror game based on the fictional stories of the SCP Foundation. <i>SCP: Labrat</i> follows the original gameplay of <i>SCP - CB</i> and adds multiple features to improve the experience.<br><br>Some <i>SCP: Labrat</i> features include:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Singleplayer and Multiplayer modes.<br></li><li> New SCPs, items, and events in addition to the originals.<br></li><li> An immersive VR player suited with a full body and physics interaction.<br></li><li> Multiple improvements to original <i>SCP - Containment Breach</i> assets.</li></ul>", "short_description": "You are a test subject in the underground SCP research facility. When a containment breach occurs, you must find your way out. Escape the SCPs, discover anomalous objects, and collect valuable resources along the way.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1402020/header.jpg?t=1753058517", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1402020/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753058517", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1402020/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753058517", "website": "https://bezbrogames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8.1 / 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR. Standing or Room Scale</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8.1 / 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 or greater<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "